{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Built for war. Modified by you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vessel, you take control of a customizable combat mech and face off in brutal one-on-one battles where every choice matters\u2014from your loadout to how you fight. Vessel is a third person fighting game with armor destruction system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through enemy armor, manage system damage, and exploit weaknesses in dynamic arenas. Powered by detailed destruction and full character customization, no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your build. Adapt on the fly. Win by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313170?t=1754169033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313170/7cb8dc04f100f8f19b161dec20967d5cecb93832/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754169033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313170/b5c9465a11afa3bd89e79ab8d208987db734d275/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754169033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313170/b5c9465a11afa3bd89e79ab8d208987db734d275/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754169033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Built for war. Modified by you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vessel, you take control of a customizable combat mech and face off in brutal one-on-one battles where every choice matters\u2014from your loadout to how you fight. Vessel is a third person fighting game with armor destruction system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through enemy armor, manage system damage, and exploit weaknesses in dynamic arenas. Powered by detailed destruction and full character customization, no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph